# ================================================================
# THIS REPO VERSIONS ONLY THE BEBIMPRO SHINY APP + DEPLOY/UVR CONFIG.
#
# The repo is rooted at `bebimpro-public/`, but git tracks a strict
# whitelist: only files the GitHub Pages app needs to build and run.
# Everything else (research docs, reports, slides, admin, and especially
# `varades/data/` — the confidential edges/nodes/subject tables, and the
# consent PDFs) is intentionally excluded from git and from the public
# deployment. uvr independently continues to manage the WHOLE
# `bebimpro-public` folder locally; git and uvr are independent.
# ================================================================

# --- 1) Ignore everything at the repo root by default ---
/*

# --- 2) Re-include the directories that lead to tracked files ---
!/.github/
!/R/
!/R/interactions-app/

# --- 3) Re-include the tracked (app + deploy + uvr config) files ---
!.github/workflows/
!.github/workflows/deploy.yaml
!/R/graph-model.R
!/R/interactions-app/app.R
!/R/interactions-app/app-utils.R
!/export-docs.R
!/README.md
!/uvr.toml
!/uvr.lock
!.Rprofile
!.r-version
!.gitignore

# --- 4) Re-exclude non-app files that fall inside whitelisted dirs ---
#     (the Shiny app needs only graph-model.R + app-utils.R + app.R)
/R/generate-xspf.R
/R/video-utils.R

# --- 5) Never commit generated state or private content, even if a
#        whitelisted path ever grows one ---
**/.DS_Store
# transient export staging dir (cleaned up on exit by export-docs.R)
**/bebimpro-stage-*/
